## Important Rules
- **ALWAYS use the cell center formula** — never eyeball coordinates.
- **ALWAYS verify adjacency** (|dr| + |dc| must equal exactly 1) before calling swipe.
- **NEVER swap diagonal, non-adjacent, or same-cell pairs.**
- Only execute ONE swap per response.
